{"id":8833357742279,"title":"Custom Tree of Life Quilt Set Celtic Yggdrasil Bedding for Bedroom Decor","handle":"custom-tree-of-life-quilt-set-yggdrasil-bedding-0038a4731b-0038a4731b","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the symbolic beauty and serene energy of the sacred tree with the Tree of Life Quilt Set by Jeminise. This beautifully designed bedding set showcases the intricate Yggdrasil and Celtic Tree of Life patterns, blending natural elegance with cozy comfort. Crafted for nature lovers, it serves as a stunning focal point for any bedroom decor while offering the versatile warmth you need for peaceful, year-round rest.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePersonalized Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully customizable options allow you to personalize the background, framing colors, and text saying squares to create a truly unique keepsake or dedicated gift.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Made from 100% soft polyester with a breathable outer fabric layer and a premium silk floss filling for lightweight warmth and long-lasting durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Exceptionally functional as a cozy bed quilt, a comfortable throw blanket, an outdoor picnic mat, or a warm companion for camping trips.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in a versatile range of sizes including Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOptional Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Complete your custom bedding set by selecting your preferred quilt size and optionally adding matching pillowcases (available in sets of 2 or 4).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washabl